;M-52: Surveyed Info: Gate Width of 8" Open Setting of 2.5" and Closed Setting of 2"
RULE OR1atM-52-00-M-52-VOR_a
IF NODE M-52-00 DEPTH > 2.5
THEN ORIFICE OR1atM-52-00-M-52-VOR  setting = .5

RULE OR1atM-52-00-M-52-VOR_b
IF NODE M-52-00 DEPTH <= 2
